%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% Scenario: Type 3 glyphs are captured in glyph space. With a font matrix
% of 0.01 and the page scaled by two, the glyph's fill of 0 0 50 50 is
% recorded as that rectangle in glyph units, and the text operation's
% matrix carries the scale: 0.02.
/Sm 7 dict dup begin
  /FontType 3 def
  /FontMatrix [0.01 0 0 0.01 0 0] def
  /Encoding StandardEncoding def
  /FontBBox [0 0 100 100] def
  /BuildGlyph { pop pop 60 0 0 0 50 50 setcachedevice 0 0 50 50 rectfill } def
end definefont pop
2 2 scale
/Sm findfont setfont
5 5 moveto (a) show
showpage
